{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"topicSections":[{"title":"Making a plan","anchor":"Making-a-plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/File","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanError"]},{"title":"Writing a plan","anchor":"Writing-a-plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files(carryingForward:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/write(to:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand"]},{"title":"Exporting an Iglu registry","anchor":"Exporting-an-Iglu-registry","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/igluFiles(vendor:registry:carryingForward:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluRegistry","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError"]},{"title":"Checking a plan","anchor":"Checking-a-plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(against:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(againstDirectory:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference"]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackingplans"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"TrackingPlans"}],"title":"TrackingPlans","externalID":"TrackingPlans","role":"collection","roleHeading":"Framework","symbolKind":"module"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracking plan is the contract between an app and whoever reads its events: dashboards, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"warehouse, a collector, another platform’s client. Each event’s document gives its version,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consent category, properties and their JSON types, which ones every payload holds, and which are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", in a form that needs no Swift to read. Committed beside the events, it puts every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change to them in the pull request as a JSON diff. Its check says which changes break what has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already shipped: payloads from installed app versions that a validating collector would reject,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and stored records the app could no longer decode.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" turns events’ schemas into files: an index, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tracking-plan.json"},{"type":"text","text":", and for each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event a JSON Schema (draft 2020-12) document and an example payload. The files are values, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same schemas give the same bytes on every run and platform, ready to commit for the people and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tools outside the app."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Checking compares the plan the events make now with the committed one by what the files mean. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck"},{"text":" is a match, a plan that is only out of date, or one with a breaking","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"difference: a change that, at the same version, would leave a stored record or an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already-released app’s payload unable to decode or validate. Each ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference"},{"text":" names","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the event, the property and the change, and says whether it is breaking.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only code compiled against the app’s event types can read their schemas, so the app writes a small"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"executable of its own: a type that conforms to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", marked "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@main"},{"type":"text","text":". It writes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the plan to a directory, or checks it with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check"},{"type":"text","text":". To run the check from the app’s tests instead,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlanTesting"},{"type":"text","text":". The schemas usually come from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventMacros"},{"type":"text","text":"):"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/init()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" takes every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":" in the program and the library’s own events, found at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"run time, and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/init(schemas:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" takes a list."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The module is a product of its own that ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Traffluent"},{"text":" leaves out.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import TrackingPlans","import Traffluent","","@Event(name: \"signed_up\")","struct SignedUp {","    var plan: String","}","","let plan = try TrackingPlan()  \/\/ every @Event in the program, and the library's own","let check = plan.check(against: plan.files)  \/\/ .matches","let paths = plan.files.map(\\.path)","\/\/ [\"tracking-plan.json\", ..., \"signed_up.v1.schema.json\", \"signed_up.v1.example.json\"]"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The plan also writes the schemas of an Iglu registry, which a Snowplow pipeline validates events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/igluFiles(vendor:registry:carryingForward:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"). Version N of an event is SchemaVer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"N-0-0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". For Iglu Server, a compatible change at the same version is the next addition, ","type":"text"},{"code":"N-0-1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and on, superseding the earlier ones; a static repository doesn’t supersede, so there the export","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refuses it, and so it does a breaking change for either kind: raise the event’s version.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The guide ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"covers the executable, the command plugins and the test.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Export every event an app tracks as JSON Schema that people and services outside the app can read, and check each change against the plan committed before it."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans"},"references":{"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlanCheck":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrackingPlanCheck"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplancheck","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"What checking a tracking plan against the committed one found: a match, a committed plan that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is only out of date, or differences that break it.","type":"text"}],"title":"TrackingPlanCheck","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrackingPlanCheck"}]},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlanDifference":{"title":"TrackingPlanDifference","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrackingPlanDifference"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"One way the plan an app’s events make now differs from the plan committed before them, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(against:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" reports it.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrackingPlanDifference"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplandifference"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/check(againstDirectory:)":{"role":"symbol","title":"check(againstDirectory:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"check","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"againstDirectory","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"URL","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials3URLV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlanCheck","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A9PlanCheckO","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Compares the plan with the one committed in "},{"code":"directory","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", as "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(against:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" does with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the directory’s files."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(againstDirectory:)","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/check(againstdirectory:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlanError":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplanerror","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlanError","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanError","kind":"symbol","title":"TrackingPlanError","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Why schemas can’t make a tracking plan."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TrackingPlanError","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/trackingplanworkflow":{"type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Exporting and Checking a Tracking Plan","type":"text"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","title":"Exporting and Checking a Tracking Plan"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans":{"title":"TrackingPlans","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Export every event an app tracks as JSON Schema that people and services outside the app can read, and check each change against the plan committed before it."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/IgluRegistry":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"IgluRegistry","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluRegistry","title":"IgluRegistry","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/igluregistry","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The kind of Iglu registry a tracking plan’s schemas are published to, which decides whether a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"compatible change can be published at the same event version"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/igluFiles(vendor:registry:carryingForward:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"IgluRegistry","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/igluFiles(vendor:registry:c